#: ../../tools/t3db_tools.rst:32 02f58e7e61ce4230ba80688e31715aa6
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed toxin information from the Toxin and Toxin-"
"Target Database (T3DB) by T3DB ID. Returns chemical properties (name, "
"CAS, formula, molecular weight), mechanism of toxicity, health effects, "
"route of exposure, and protein/gene targets with UniProt IDs. Covers "
"3,678 common toxins including pollutants, pesticides, drugs, and food "
"toxins. Use for toxicology research, environmental health, and chemical "
"safety assessment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/t3db_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/t3db_tools.rst:65
#: 6a8981109c96495eae14cec7f61af839 aa056ed509dd44fdba933512403b4b00
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/t3db_tools.rst:36 ffc11d9204d24026bdf42c9eafc56786
msgid ""
"``toxin_id`` (string) (required) T3DB toxin ID (e.g., 'T3D0001' for "
"Arsenic, 'T3D0002' for Lead). Numeric-only input is auto-prefixed with "
"T3D."
msgstr ""

